  "referenceNumber": "RUS3066",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect that ALT CAPITAL is or has been involved in destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine, by making available funds, economic resources, goods or technology, that could contribute to destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine.\n",
